      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-27T17:17:18.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹63.33 (vs ₹78.81 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹63.33 (down from ₹78.81 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹9.03b (up 14% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹642.4m (down 20% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.1% (down from 10% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 10% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 1% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
