      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-05-26T13:30:00.000Z",
      "title": "Honda India Power Products Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year Ended March 31, 2026, Payable on September 17, 2026",
      "body": "Honda India Power Products Limited announced that at the board meeting held on May 26, 2026, Recommendation of a final dividend of INR 23 per equity share i.e., (23%) on Equity Shares of face value of INR 10/- each fully paid-up, for the Financial Year ended March 31, 2026, subject To Approve the Shareholders at the upcoming AGM. The said dividend, if approved, shall be paid to the shareholders on September 17, 2026. The Company has fixed August 19, 2026 as the record date for payment of final dividend, if approved by the shareholders in the upcoming AGM of the Company.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "45",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
